WEBVTT

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.730
Mt. Fuji Viewing Spot

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.730
How is Mt. Fuji today?

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:39.090
First, we have to give it an 
aroma using olive oil and garlic.

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.730
I got some water.

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:41.990
Thanks.

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:47.550
Stir in some canned tomato and water...

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:51.750
Add some fresh cream, meat, and veggies...

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:53.550
And simmer.

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.390
And we top it off with this.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:00.890
Right, canned tuna.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.800
Sprinkle on some basil...

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:07.390
How are things over there?

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.730
It's toasted.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.520
It smells good!

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:16.030
Time to eat!

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.030
Yum!

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:20.850
Who knew you could have 
such a feast in the mountains?

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:22.060
I'm glad you like it.

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:23.530
What do you think, Hinata?

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.220
Yeah, it's good.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.340
Thanks.

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.930
The hot dogs are cooked well, too.

00:02:30.930 --> 00:02:33.160
And the sausages are juicy.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.210
<i>My first traversal.</i>

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:41.720
<i>We're going to Mt. Kinpu tomorrow.</i>

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:42.800
Aoi-chan!

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:43.680
Aoi-san!

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:45.700
Could you come out here?

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:51.940
The sky cleared up.

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:54.360
Looks like the weather
 will be nice tomorrow, too.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:57.590
Vulpecula, Delphinus, Equuleus...

00:02:57.590 --> 00:02:59.490
I can't believe they're so visible.

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:08.650
Hinata?

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.220
We don't have anything to do.

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:19.550
Let's go to sleep.

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:21.600
Tomorrow's going to be harder.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.300
We need to rest well.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.160
Okay.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.500
Goodnight.

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:29.310
Goodnight.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:40.370
<i>I still can't sleep.</i>

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:43.830
<i>I need to get some good sleep, 
or Hinata's going to get mad again.</i>

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.790
<i>I wonder if Hinata's asleep already...</i>

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.350
<i>She's an even worse sleeper than Hinata.</i>

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.940
What time is it?

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:15.440
Alarm

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.020
Good morning!

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:19.980
Let's make it a good day!

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.740
We can just leave the tents here, right?

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:24.560
Yeah.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.850
We can pack them up on our way down.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:29.740
It's nice that we can leave 
our heavy stuff here.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:36.250
<b>Mt. Kinpu</b>

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:34.460
Mt. Kinpu has more areas that 
are chained off or crumbly.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.250
There's a lot more walking distance, too.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:38.160
Let's be strong.

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:39.000
Okay.

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.840
Want to go at the front today, Hinata-chan?

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:47.550
Once we're past the forest line, we'll be 
walking along a ridge with a nice view.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.240
Let's make it all the way there.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.010
Okay.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.020
Fujimidaira

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.020
Takami-iwa

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:52.020
Ministry of the Environment, 
Yamanashi Prefecture

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:07.760
Hinata?

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:10.250
Is something wrong, Hinata-san?

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:11.880
I'm fine.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.710
Maybe you should slow down, Hinata.

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:25.760
I said I'm fine.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.670
Oohi-iwa
40 minutes

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.670
Mt. Kinpu Peak
1 hour

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.040
Hinata?

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:11.860
My knee's been hurting a bit since yesterday.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:14.470
I didn't think it was a big deal.

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:16.180
Why didn't you say anything?

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:17.500
Sorry.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:20.130
I didn't want to worry all of you.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:24.670
It takes a while for knees to 
heal once they've been hurt.

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.070
You can't push yourself.

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:27.470
You're right.

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:30.310
I think I'll stop here.

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:34.930
I'll go back and wait at the bottom.

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:37.200
You three go to the top.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.060
No way!

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:39.770
We can't just leave you, Hinata-san!

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:42.480
It's my own fault.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:46.070
We can't leave you by 
yourself when you're hurt.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:47.650
But...

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:49.800
I'll stay, then.

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:53.990
You two go to the peak.

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.750
I'll walk Hinata home.

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:57.650
It's fine.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.820
You don't need to put up with me.

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:00.490
No!

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.010
But then you're...

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:04.690
I can't just leave you!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.700
Leave the rest to me.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:11.810
Okay.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:14.430
Aoi-chan, take care of Hinata-chan for us.

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:16.950
I feel better knowing you're with her.

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:18.170
Thanks.

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:19.830
Be careful.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:32.380
Are you okay?

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:33.790
I can take your bag.

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:37.140
Just watch how much strength I've gained.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.980
Let's take a short break.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:56.240
The view's not bad here, either.

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:03.240
The sky's clear, and the 
wind is nice and cool.

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:09.670
Um, and...

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.320
And...

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.530
Oh, right.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:17.760
<b>Ogura
Youkan</b>

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.760
Want a youkan?

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:28.860
What are you, a grandpa?

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:31.820
I haven't heard that comeback in a while.

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:32.870
Jeez.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:34.660
Thanks.

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:37.080
Are you in a better mood now?

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:40.060
Sorry for making you worry yesterday.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.200
I'm sorry, too.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:47.360
I got too angry yesterday.

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:52.690
I haven't been too happy 
with stuff these days.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:53.720
So...

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:56.180
Happy with what stuff?

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:59.550
Like, we kept missing each other.

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:00.960
We did?

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:02.410
Did something happen?

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:07.340
Well, our plans to hang 
out kept falling through.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:13.000
Meanwhile, you were having fun with 
Honoka-chan and Mio and them.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.730
I heard you were with Kokona-chan 
yesterday, too, and I...

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:18.960
What's this about? Were you jealous?

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:19.830
Is that bad?

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:26.960
It's more that I was 
worried you might go away.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.640
Like back in elementary school.

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:32.680
It wasn't because you're 
moving away this time,

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:36.290
but I thought you might be fine without me.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.650
You're so stupid.

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:41.480
Of course not.

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:45.950
It was all thanks to you that 
I started mountain climbing

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:51.230
and made more friends in high school.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:54.820
We might not always be together,

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:59.910
but you'll always be my dearest friend.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:00.880
Aoi...

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.160
Jeez, don't make me 
embarrass myself like that.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:08.710
Sorry.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:15.960
I think mountains have a way 
of making people honest.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.220
Yeah.

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:22.780
It sure is a nice view.

00:10:22.780 --> 00:10:23.720
Right?

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:29.690
<i>Panorama for two, hands held together</i>

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:34.940
<i>Let's look through them and get excited</i>

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:42.120
<i>The harder you work, the more you're rewarded</i>

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.710
We're back.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:45.370
Welcome back!

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:47.310
How was the peak?

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.600
It was the best.

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:49.690
It was!

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:53.250
<i>So let's go together</i>

00:10:53.250 --> 00:11:00.250
<i>At the end of the day, we're friends</i>

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:07.770
<i>So we take hand in hand and head for the top</i>

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.280
<b>Higashi-Hanno Station - West Gate</b>

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:22.140
Okay, see you.

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:23.420
Goodbye.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:24.780
Bye.

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.740
I can go from here.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:32.840
No way. I'll walk you home.

00:11:32.840 --> 00:11:34.040
I'm fine.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.290
Nope.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.050
You're hurt. You need to do as you're told.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.370
I'm home.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.150
Welcome home.

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:44.050
You must be tired. The bath's ready.

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:45.770
We walked so much.

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:47.150
My legs are jelly.

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:47.680
Yeah.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.530
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.540
Yeah.

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:53.130
See you tomorrow.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.910
Hang on, Aoi!

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:04.510
I have a gift I haven't given you yet.

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:05.490
I'll go get it.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:07.570
What is it?

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:11.290
You'll see it soon enough.

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:15.210
Come on, why are you making 
it such a big deal?

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.380
You're raising my expectations.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.740
It's something really awesome.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:21.380
<b>Friends</b>

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:21.100
What could it be?
